OL,3,AWhy Kim Kardashian came back to 'the
OL,4,Aworst TV drama ever'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut viewers mostly enjoyed its comedy
OL,7,Fvalue - with outlandish outfits and
OL,8,Fzingy one-liners from co-stars Sarah
OL,9,FPaulson and Glenn Close sending the
OL,10,Fshow straight into the pantheon of
OL,11,F'camp classics'.
